- Verdict format: `**Adversarial review (Fable, ext/<id>, independent of the author): APPROVE | REQUEST CHANGES** — head <sha>`, with numbered findings (severity, file:line, failing scenario, fix).
- Security problem: write only "REQUEST CHANGES — security finding, details sent privately". The details go to the maintainer only.
- Merge: the steward merges, because this touches tokens and sessions. The author does not merge.

